+Prerequisites: SQL Server TCP/IP enabled on a fixed port (usually `1433`), a SQL-authentication login with migration permissions, Python, and Node.js. A named SQL Server instance should be assigned a fixed TCP port; provide the host and port rather than a named-instance string. The app uses SQL authentication, not SSMS Windows/Integrated Authentication.
